# Task decomposition (WBS)

On-demand. Canon: `skills/task-decomposition/SKILL.md` · template: `templates/wbs/WBS-TEMPLATE.md`.

## Do

1. Qualifying work → write one WBS file in the **project** (`docs/wbs/{slug}.md` or existing `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`).
2. Skip empty levels. Do not invent dummy epics.
3. Every L5 has `verify:` (code/SEO/design/n8n/governance — see skill).
4. Stop and ask «Утвердить дерево?» before L4/L5 work.
5. `!auto` + Deliverables contract → write WBS, run **first epic only**.
6. TodoWrite = current 1–3 packages. File = source of status.

## Do not

- Five floors on a one-line fix
- Restore quarantined `writing-plans`
- Always-on hierarchy
- Parallel Task unless epics are file-independent
